Package: homelab-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-requests, python3-yaml
Description: Command-line client for homelab-api
 Register/login/whoami/logout against homelab-api's JSON REST API, and
 look up a feature's address in the service registry. Session
 (token/refresh_token) is stored 0600 in ~/.config/homelab-cli/session.yml,
 separate from the non-secret api_base config. The one shipped package
 in this ecosystem deliberately allowed to be Python rather than Perl
 (see CLAUDE.md's Language section) — a good fit for a pure CLI tool
 that's mostly argument parsing and HTTP calls.
